      },
      "text": "8 November · Machu Picchu from Cusco"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:c3205ac1e20a266d",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "66458965546451480483ac82e6ca1f0d9847081db6a990c11e360c9bf5dee594",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-work-20261107-d7e179628a0b",
        "model": "ChatGPT"
      },
      "text": "Breakfast at the hotel. Take a full-day group trip to Machu Picchu with an English-speaking guide. Lunch is included. Return to Cusco by train and transfer to your hotel."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:contentBlock_text:a946a05257b09026",
      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "66458965546451480483ac82e6ca1f0d9847081db6a990c11e360c9bf5dee594",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-work-20261107-d7e179628a0b",
        "model": "ChatGPT"
      },
      "text": "Breakfast at the hotel. Take a full-day group trip to Machu Picchu with an English-speaking guide. Lunch is included. Return to Cusco by train and transfer to your hotel."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:contentBlock_text:ec68c76d994384fe",
      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "e25b7da5f3a0ecdff679eca167bffbd70a1b1001561f2b8e16ec85d1e9ab76ba",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-work-20261107-d7e179628a0b",
        "model": "ChatGPT"
      },
      "text": "Take a full-day group tour of Machu Picchu, the ‘Lost City of the Incas’, with an English-speaking guide. According to one account, some of the most learned Inca priests retreated here after the fall of the empire. The Spanish never found the city. The Incas fitted massive stone blocks together without mortar to build it on a mountaintop surrounded by dense forest. American explorer Hiram Bingham brought the site to international attention in 1911. Lunch. Return to Cusco by train and transfer to your hotel on arrival."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:media_alt:a51cab100ac29798",
