        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-work-20261107-d7e179628a0b",
        "model": "ChatGPT"
      },
      "text": "Stone terraces and ruins at Machu Picchu beneath a high mountain peak in Peru"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:media_hover:58b49eafb967a086",
